<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Application Submission Failed | Narsimha Astro</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --maroon: #631a2a;
            --gold: #e3b35e;
            --cream: #fff9ef
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--cream);
            color: #39231f;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column
        }

        header {
            background: var(--maroon);
            padding: 20px 7%;
            color: #ffd58a;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 24px
        }

        .container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px 18px
        }

        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #eadac2;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 52px 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px #51221914
        }

        .symbol {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            width: 88px;
            height: 88px;
            margin: 0 auto 22px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #fff0ee;
            color: #b62d36;
            font-size: 52px;
            font-weight: bold
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            color: var(--maroon);
            font-size: clamp(27px, 5vw, 38px);
            margin: 0 0 18px
        }

        p {
            color: #665650;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 0 auto 26px;
            max-width: 440px
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: center
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: var(--maroon);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 7px;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            font-weight: bold
        }

        .btn.secondary {
            background: #f5e9d7;
            color: var(--maroon)
        }

        footer {
            background: #37141c;
            color: #e5cdbb;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px;
            font-size: 13px
        }

        @media(max-width:480px) {
            header {
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 20px
            }

            .card {
                padding: 36px 20px
            }

            .actions {
                flex-direction: column
            }

            .btn {
                width: 100%
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>NARSIMHA ASTRO</header>
    <main class="container">
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="heading">
            <div class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">!</div>
            <h1 id="heading">Application Submission Failed</h1>
            <p>We couldn't submit your astrologer application at this time. Please check your internet connection and
                try again. If the problem continues, contact our support team.</p>
            <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/">Back to Home</a></div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <footer>© 2026 Narsimha Astro · Vedic wisdom for modern life</footer>
</body>

</html>